'''Inflatable Jerry''' is a {{Common}} [[Dungeon Item]] which can be used to scare away [[Dungeon Mobs#Basic Enemies|Non-Boss mobs]] in [[Dungeons]]. The mobs will run in the opposite direction, while text displays above their head that reads: "JERRY, RUN"

There is a {{Green|20%}} chance that it will pop when used and not activate.

There are some limitations to the effect. [[Dungeon Mobs#Bosses|Bosses]] and [[Dungeon Mobs#Mini-Bosses|Mini-Bosses]] are not affected by Jerry. Furthermore, it will always fail to activate around Bosses no matter how many are placed. Thus, in boss fights like [[Necron]], it is advised to stay away from the boss to activate it.

== Obtaining ==
'''Inflatable Jerries''' can be found in [[Dungeons]] while doing [[Dungeon Secrets#List of Secret Rewards|Secrets]].

== Trivia ==
* Its description is quoted from the movie ''The Fellowship of the Ring''.
** This quote comes from a scene where the Character ''Galadriel'' presents ''Frodo'' with a phial of light called the ''Phial of Galadriel''.
* Randomly, this item may turn into a [[Spawn Egg|Villager Spawn Egg]].
* The text "JERRY, RUN" is a reference to the movie "Forrest Gump" in where there is a scene where a character says “RUN FORREST, RUN!”.
* Inflatable Jerry can be used as a [[Dungeon Secrets|Dungeon Secret]] for the [[Secret I Potion]].

